# Binary assets — never normalise line endings or diff.
# Text files keep the repository's existing checkout behaviour (core.autocrlf);
# the web test helpers normalise CRLF->LF at their read point, so they pass on
# both a CRLF (windows CI) and an LF checkout. Do not add a global text/eol rule:
# the help/guide content is deliberately CRLF and its tests assert that.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.wasm binary
*.pdf binary
*.bin binary
*.dat binary